      "title": "Committees Internal Regulations",
      "body": "This document outlines the internal regulations of Buhurt International Committees. It specifies the rules that must be followed by all members of the Committees, regardless of their rank, title, status, or other distinctions.\n\nThe document also details the disciplinary sanctions applicable in case of rule violations.\n\n1.Rules All members of the Committee must comply with the following rules:",
