      "ordinal": 10,
      "depth": 2,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "2.1.1",
      "title": "Minor Issue",
      "body": "A minor issue is a violation of a rule that does not cause damage to the reputation of a Committee or Buhurt International.\nIt's an issue that isn't severe enough to warrant suspension or removal. However, the Committee member must understand that it is significant enough to justify a sanction.\nExamples:\n●Disrespectful public behavior (including online). I.e: being impolite with third party, ●Inadequate knowledge of the rules during a tournament or any Buhurt International event, ●Misapplication of rules.",
